Description: Backport dependent current-instantiation member lookup and corrections.
Origin: backport, https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/commit/8009bbec59d1c5d47ae06c431647ebee6d886ff2
Origin: backport, https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/commit/75ebcbf24abb2e5b045ec920bc86f667516e4cc6
Origin: backport, https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/commit/596a9c1f9b3179b3c77cbde1e96619292ce2a10a
Origin: backport, https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/commit/9e1f1cfa59c4513798de5c326d77e1e5912b1634
Origin: backport, https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/commit/f061a395ffb78215a23e0f503e8ea121ee3b13ad
 Adapted to LLVM18 Sema APIs, dr namespace names and release-note locations.
 Retains the regression tests from PR90999 and PR91498 although their
 assignment lookup implementation is superseded by PR91620.
 This corrects GCC16 hidden-friend trailing return type lookup without
 weakening class-completeness checks or modifying standard-library headers.

